@startuml sd02-clarifying-question
title SD02 — Clarifying Question and Vault Learning (F06)
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor Student
boundary "TailorView\n<<QuestionHandler>>" as TV
control AgentController as AC
participant "LLMClient" as LLM
participant ToolRegistry as TR
participant AskUserTool as AUT
participant VaultService as VS
database VaultRepository as VR

note over AC, LLM : Agent loop from SD01 is running.\nThe draft needs a fact that is not in the vault\n(e.g. which framework the course project used).
AC -> LLM : complete(request)
LLM --> AC : toolCalls=[ask_user({question})]
AC -> TR : execute(call, session)
TR -> AUT : execute(args, session)
AUT -> TV : ask("Which framework did the EECS 3401 chatbot use?")
TV --> Student : show question dialog
alt Student answers
  Student -> TV : "Python + OpenAI API"
  TV --> AUT : Optional.of(answer)
  AUT -> VS : fileAnswer(question, answer)
  VS -> VS : match existing entry or create new VaultEntry
  VS -> VR : save(entry)
  AUT --> TR : ToolResult(ok, answer)
else Student skips
  TV --> AUT : Optional.empty()
  AUT --> TR : ToolResult(ok, "UNKNOWN - do not state this fact")
end
TR --> AC : ToolResult
AC -> AC : session.addMessage(toolResult)
note over AC : Loop continues; with UNKNOWN the agent must\nleave the detail out or use a placeholder like [N=5].
@enduml
